mixin radiobuttons(className)
  .radiobutton-wrapper(class=className) 
     p.radiobutton__item
      input.radiobutton__input(type='radio' id='man' name='radio-group' checked)
      label.radiobutton__item-label(for='man') Мужчина 
     p.radiobutton__item
      input.radiobutton__input(type='radio' id='woman' name='radio-group')
      label.radiobutton__item-label(for='woman') Женщина